# Copy to .env.local (dev) or configure via your deploy pipeline's env injection for
# .env.production -- Vite picks up whichever applies automatically, no code changes needed.
#
# Used only by Diagnostics.tsx's "More detail" links (Swagger/Actuator) -- both live outside
# /api entirely on the backend, so they can't go through the dev-server's /api proxy the rest of
# this app relies on. Every other API call in this app uses relative /api paths and needs no
# configuration here; don't add more entries to this file just to "be consistent" unless
# something else genuinely can't use the proxy either.
#
# Defaults to http://localhost:8080 if unset (matches vite.config.ts's own proxy target).
VITE_BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8080
